{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_183_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"一、二年，春，晉侯使韓起來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_183_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔弓如晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_183_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"三、秋，鄭殺其大夫公孫黑。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_183_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"四、冬，公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_183_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"恥如晉，故著有疾也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_183_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"五、季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_183_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_183","textTraditional":"公如晉而不得入，季孫宿如晉而得入，惡季孫宿也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}